                                "sense_id": "a8f7962d-512e-39e5-b497-2b74138b7ee3",
                                "text": "They set off again, the tall, elegant human and the violet-skinned exotic, too abstracted to farsee the person waiting for them in the shadows a few dozen meters ahead."
